"P3005012951" "Gully, a Forlorn, said that his scavenger team braved the Free-Fire Zone, discovering a D.U.S.T. munitions depot along the way. They came under attack by an Apparition and Gully fled, leaving the rest of his team still in the FFZ. He gave you a damaged tac-scanner that you can use to track them down."

