// Objective - ScriptSurgeonDropsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3823756040" "Destroy the Surgeon and his Apparitions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptMedSuppliesStolen1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4184368294" "Medical Suppy Station"
// Description :
"P1812720497" "medical supply caches to be retrieved"
// SingularDescription :
"P3055192235" "Retrieve the last batch of medical supplies"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1316233722" "You begin gathering medical supplies"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3958795327" "Medical supplies retrieved."
// InteractActionString :
"P4191481758" "Retrieving medical supplies..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1350606263" "You collect a sample of universal anti-toxins derived from some sea-creature native to the Sunken City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptMedSuppliesStolen2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P385286420" "This supply cache contains an array of epidermal hyper-sealants and a few useful field medi-packs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3045754139" "You retrieved the medical supplies the Compound needs and, perhaps more importantly, all pertinent medical records regarding the Awakened, but they're fragmentary and mostly inconclusive. You have the feeling that you're going to have to call in an expert psychic to get much further."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4032179752" "What the..? The medical records only really show that D.U.S.T. is playing theory time, too. The words 'inconclusive' and 'possible' are used about every third sentence. Hrmm.<br><br>There <i>has</i>  to be some truth to it, though...between the dispatches you found at ARCLIGHT and these medical records is a connection that the Asylum doesn't want getting out <i>at all.</i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CandlestickNobleDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2587766711" "<color yellow>I can only discuss things with your task owner.</color>"
// Page CandlestickTalks Text :
"P3321920446" "Eckery ackery, me ol' friend, you've come to get the skinny on those new bone polishers runnin' amok in the personascape, aren't ya now?"
// Answer Text :
"P4128490481" "What? I'm hear to ask about the Awakened."
// Page AwakenedPage Text :
"P410415211" "Thas' what I said now, ennit? Look, my coins are on it all bein' a con, these Awakened. They're Seers of a sort, and the Seer Network is one of the biggest cons of all."
// Answer Text :
"P368977365" "LOOK, JUST SPIT IT OUT, YOU FREAK!"
// Page CalmDownPage Text :
"P2374737753" "Hey now, {Hero.gender=male boyo|girlie}! Don't cut yerself with that tongue, hear me? Right rude, you are.<br><br>Now listen, the psychics of the Carnival, including yours truly, we're not even <b>about</b> to dare Fate by probing the thoughts o' those Awakened. It could become a two-way street, an' I like my mind right where it sits, y'know? Seers are serious business, and these whackjobs are off their leash.<br><br><color orange>The most famous of the Seers that got away from the Network is Katie Douglas.</color> Maybe you already know her. A celebrity, she is. Well, to some folks, anyhow."
// Answer Text :
"P30759937" "Candlestick...I want to apologize for my... outburst. (optional)"
// Answer Text :
"P1854108640" "How can I find her?"
// Page ApologizePage Text :
"P814649437" "S'all right, {Hero.gender=male lad|lass}. Don't fret. All of us First Warders get the shouts sometimes and just yell the fool. The gumbo can get to a body, ya know?"
// Answer Text :
"P1862438765" "Thanks. Where can I find Katie Douglas?"
// Page WhereIsShePage Text :
"P2758392834" "For a jail bird that wants to stay off the grid, Katie Douglas doesn't exactly take great pains t'hide her whereabouts. <color orange>Scuttlebutt's that she and a few Seers she's rescued from the Network have holed up in Office 1381.</color><br><br>The name of said domicile is both an inside joke an' a dare to anyone Coleside that might be thinkin' of comin' after her. <color orange>Look for Katie Douglas there.</color><br><br>But be warned. She's not too fond of the Compound, and wants zero to do with the Carnival. That said, if you need an expert on Seers, and the skinny on the Awakened, Katie's yer best bet."
// Answer Text :
"P3928765808" "I'll find her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - KatieDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NoMoreToSayRightNowPage Text :
"P331722161" "What are you waiting for? Report back to the Compound. I've got stuff to take care of."
// Page AmbushOverPage Text :
"P2922068759" "Okay, <i>killer.</i> Your mind says you're here about the Awakened.<br><br>What do <i>they</i>  have to do with all of these Apparitions everywhere?"
// Answer Text :
"P1943650543" "That's what I was hoping you could tell me."
// Page OpeningPageSouvenir Text :
"P770846578" "And just what do <i>you</i>  want?<br><br>Wait up, do I <i>know</i> you from somewhere?"
// Answer Text :
"P737433728" "You should. I helped you and your Seers escape from Praetor Tilman, remember?"
// Answer Text :
"P2969103548" "You should. I gave you up to Praetor Tilman. How'd you escape?"
// Page EscapeFromTilmanPage Text :
"P803101960" "'Escape from Praetor Tilman'..? What are you talking about? I...I did that <i>all on my own.</i><br><br>Didn't I?<br><br><i>Which time are we talking about?</i><br><br><color orange>Katie looks strangely confused, as if trying to recollect memories that no longer exist for her. Or conflicting ones that are overlapping in her mind too fast.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P882108948" "Calm down, it doesn't matter. But now I need your help."
// Page GaveYouToTilmanPage Text :
"P2146733147" "What? That wasn't <i>you</i>...that was...wait, what are you talking about?<br><br><i>Which time are we talking about?</i><br><br><color orange>Katie looks strangely confused, as if trying to recollect memories that no longer exist for her. Or conflicting ones that are overlapping in her mind too fast.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1784302735" "Glad you forgot all about it, because now I need your help."
// Page OpeningPageNoSouvenir Text :
"P1977371175" "And just what do <i>you</i>  want?"
// Answer Text :
"P570879620" "I need your help."
// Page HelpPage Text :
"P3026221686" "Help <i>you</i> ..?! After you bring Apparitions into my house and they kill my sisters? <i>Do you know what you've done?</i>"
// Answer Text :
"P425072489" "I had no idea the Apparitions were after you until I arrived."
// Page NoIdeaPage Text :
"P1858291139" "<color orange>Katie Douglas scans your mind.</color><br><br>You're...you're telling the truth. But you...you had <i>some</i> idea they might be. Wait, you had one inside you! Or was it two?<br><br>Oh, and I guess <i>that</i> string of confusion I'm now reading in your head is what you call an excuse. Yeah, so, that's so <i>not</i>  going to work with me--<br><br>Wait. Can you hear that? More are coming!"
// Answer Text :
"P4165484413" "Then no more excuses. Get ready."
// Page GetReadyPage Text :
"P887085577" "You're going to owe me for this, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2145629067" "(Fight)"
// Page HopingYouCouldTellMePage Text :
"P2929824409" "<color orange>Katie Douglas scans your mind again.</color><br><br>Fine, I'll help you out. It looks like you've been trying to figure out the connection between the Apparitions and the Awakened for a while, and I see that you've been doing some good for First Ward along the way. Things are going to get ugly before we reach the end of this road.<br><br>But let's be clear: I <i>won't</i>  forget what was done to my sisters and I will <i>always</i> associate it with you.<br><br>Go back and tell Noble Savage that I'm on board. I'll be in touch after that."
// Answer Text :
"P3719693364" "It's a deal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2456013720" "<color orange>We need to consult an expert on psychic phenomena.</color> I know about mind control, but after that? Next to nothing. I'm going to assume that these Awakened are an immediate threat to the Compound, and our only psychic allies are those in the Carnival of Light. I understand the <i>last</i>  Hetman shook that alliance up pretty bad, so I'd like you to speak to them on my behalf.<br><br>The one named Candlestick used his powers to confirm that the Palatine was real, correct? <color orange>Start by talking with him.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3150856245" "YESSIR, SIR! I CAN'T WAIT, SIR!"
// SendOffString :
