"P99715392" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod> Ha. They are wearing D.U.S.T. shells.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>IT WON'T HELP THEM! SHE IS MY PATIENT! I MEAN 'HOST'!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You mean our host. But, yes, we will have to deal with them...hand me the scalpel, please."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2277416543" "<t=3 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>THAT WITCH CAN'T TELL ME WHAT TO DO ANYMORE!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1550207982" "<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>KATIE DOUGLAS BELONGS TO US NOW!<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>She'll be a much better shell than {HeroName} here. I don't particularly like the taste of {Hero.gender=male his|her} surface thoughts."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P967821331" "<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>KATIE DOUGLAS IS NEAR! LET'S GO!<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Severing the telepathic-tendon...now. Her body will guarantee me tenure, I'm sure of it."

