// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2696672849" "During your search for Katie Douglas, the Apparition of the Surgeon piggybacked on your psyche, causing all manner of confusion and violence. Katie's ex-Seers were all dead, victims to possessed D.U.S.T. Rangers. It seems that other Apparitions were after the famous Seer 1381, too. The Surgeon jumped from you towards Katie Douglas when it felt she was near, and you had to rescue her from another possession. In the end, Katie agreed to help you search for the answers behind the Awakened, insane and mutated Seers now threatening the whole of First Ward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P873193909" "Well done, {HeroName}. Katie Douglas was something of a legend in Praetoria proper. If anyone can help us get to the bottom of the Awakened and how D.U.S.T. fell so easily to their power, she's our best bet.<br><br>Watch yourself around her, though. She's got a personal agenda that doesn't always play nice with others."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P2361470652" "I'm not sure what it is these days, but I keep getting angry at the smallest of things."
